\ recurse.8th -- Thinking 8th, Chapter 8
\ Verified with: 8th code/ch08/recurse.8th
\
\ Direct self-reference, the one DOER/MAKE job that isn't really about
\ changeable behavior at all -- 8th just has a dedicated word for it.

: fact  \ n -- n!
  dup 1 n:> if
    dup n:1- recurse n:*
  else
    drop 1
  then ;

5 fact . cr    \ => 120

bye
